  unitName: Mysterious Knight Zeal
  unitId: 60954
  unitNumber: 1322
  description: A disciple of the god Kulyuk, one of the Divine Ten. Zeal disliked
    interacting with others and always wore a mask to keep his distance, but did
    jump to the occasion when a chance to serve Kulyuk presented itself. He was regarded
    as quite the talented disciple thanks to his great agility and stealth, which
    were perfect for conducting the secret missions his master usually entrusted
    him with. Although Zeal usually avoided the battlefield during his missions,
    he did wield a double edged spear made of an unknown material when he had no
    choice but to fight. Legend has it he displayed incredible strength in battle.
  summonDesc: My identity is no business of yours.<br>Now hurry.<br>Give me your
    orders.
  fusionDesc: If you are strengthening me, it must<br>mean my own power doesn't suffice.<br>I
    will remember that..
  evoDesc: 
